{
  "id": "510",
  "title": "Manager Wang's Excuse",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-06-06",
  "synopsis": "Manager Wang needs an excuse to avoid a pushy salesperson.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/757/82bc0305c0f418d56b5b48ce506bd2941d6093e9.mp3?1698351292",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "就说……\n\n小何：王总，刚才大森公司销售部的黄方打电话来，想请您明天去吃饭，他请客。\n王总：准是又想向我推销东西的。黄方这个人，每次和他吃饭，他都说个不停，一说就是好几个小时，我哪有那么多闲工夫和他吃饭啊？你帮我回个电话给他，就说……\n小何：就说您有重要的会议。\n王总：对对对，说我明天有个重要的会议。",
    "traditional": "就說……\n\n小何：王總，剛才大森公司銷售部的黃方打電話來，想請您明天去吃飯，他請客。\n王總：準是又想向我推銷東西的。黃方這個人，每次和他吃飯，他都說個不停，一說就是好幾個小時，我哪有那麼多閑工夫和他吃飯啊？你幫我回個電話給他，就說……\n小何：就說您有重要的會議。\n王總：對對對，說我明天有個重要的會議。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Just say that…"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小何：王总，刚才大森公司销售部的黄方打电话来，",
      "traditional": "小何：王總，剛才大森公司銷售部的黃方打電話來，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wáng zǒng gāng cái dà sēn gōng sī xiāo shòu bù de huáng fāng dǎ diàn huà lái",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "想请您明天去吃饭，他请客。",
      "traditional": "想請您明天去吃飯，他請客。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎng qǐng nín míng tiān qù chī fàn tā qǐng kè",
      "english": "Little He: Manager Wang, there was a phone call from Huang Fang from the Dasen Company just now."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He wants to invite you to a meal tomorrow, his treat."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "王总：准是又想向我推销东西的。",
      "traditional": "王總：準是又想向我推銷東西的。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng zhǔn shì yòu xiǎng xiàng wǒ tuī xiāo dōng xi de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "黄方这个人，每次和他吃饭，他都说个不停，一说就是好几个小时，",
      "traditional": "黃方這個人，每次和他吃飯，他都說個不停，一說就是好幾個小時，",
      "pinyin": "huáng fāng zhè ge rén měi cì hé tā chī fàn tā dōu shuō ge bù tíng yì shuō jiù shì hǎo jǐ ge xiǎo shí",
      "english": "Manager Wang: He definitely wants to market stuff to me again."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我哪有那么多闲工夫和他吃饭啊？",
      "traditional": "我哪有那麼多閑工夫和他吃飯啊？",
      "pinyin": "wǒ nǎ yǒu nà me duō xián gōng fu hé tā chī fàn a",
      "english": "That Huang Fang… Whenever we have a meal he talks to no end, and once he begins talking he talks for hours."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "你帮我回个电话给他，就说……",
      "traditional": "你幫我回個電話給他，就說……",
      "pinyin": "nǐ bāng wǒ huí ge diàn huà gěi tā jiù shuō",
      "english": "When would I ever have enough free time to have a meal with him?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Call him back for me. Just say that…"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小何：就说您有重要的会议。",
      "traditional": "小何：就說您有重要的會議。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé jiù shuō nín yǒu zhòng yào de huì yì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: … say that you have an important meeting."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "王总：对对对，说我明天有个重要的会议。",
      "traditional": "王總：對對對，說我明天有個重要的會議。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng duì duì duì shuō wǒ míng tiān yǒu ge zhòng yào de huì yì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Yes yes yes. Say that I have an important meeting tomorrow."
    }
  ],
