    "sentence_translations": [
      "Just say that…",
      "",
      "Little He: Manager Wang, there was a phone call from Huang Fang from the Dasen Company just now.",
      "He wants to invite you to a meal tomorrow, his treat.",
      "",
      "Manager Wang: He definitely wants to market stuff to me again.",
      "That Huang Fang… Whenever we have a meal he talks to no end, and once he begins talking he talks for hours.",
      "When would I ever have enough free time to have a meal with him?",
      "Call him back for me. Just say that…",
      "",
      "Little He: … say that you have an important meeting.",
      "",
      "Manager Wang: Yes yes yes. Say that I have an important meeting tomorrow.",
      ""
